<!doctype html><html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>초과근무 계산기</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{font-family:system-ui,'Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;background:#f3f6fb;margin:0;padding:30px;color:#17243b}.wrap{max-width:520px;margin:auto;background:white;border-radius:18px;padding:30px;box-shadow:0 8px 28px #17243b16}h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:25px}p{color:#64748b;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}label{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin:17px 0 7px}input{width:100%;padding:12px;border:1px solid #d6deea;border-radius:9px;font-size:16px}button{width:100%;background:#2358d6;color:white;border:0;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;margin-top:22px;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}.result{background:#edf4ff;border-radius:12px;padding:20px;margin-top:20px}.line{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin:10px 0}.total{font-size:23px;color:#1749b5;font-weight:800}.note{font-size:12px;color:#64748b;margin-top:16px}</style></head><body><main class="wrap"><h1>⏱ 초과근무 계산기</h1><p>근무시간과 기본 근무시간을 입력하면 초과근무시간과 예상 수당을 계산합니다.</p><div class="grid"><div><label for="start">출근 시간</label><input id="start" type="time" value="09:00"></div><div><label for="end">퇴근 시간</label><input id="end" type="time" value="20:00"></div><div><label for="breaks">휴게시간 (분)</label><input id="breaks" type="number" min="0" value="60"></div><div><label for="regular">기본 근무시간 (시간)</label><input id="regular" type="number" min="0" step="0.5" value="8"></div></div><label for="rate">초과근무 시간당 수당 (원)</label><input id="rate" type="number" min="0" value="15000"><button onclick="calculate()">계산하기</button><section class="result" aria-live="polite"><div class="line"><span>실제 근무시간</span><strong id="worked">-</strong></div><div class="line"><span>초과근무시간</span><strong id="extra">-</strong></div><hr style="border:0;border-top:1px solid #d1def5;margin:17px 0"><div class="line"><span>예상 초과근무수당</span><span class="total" id="pay">-</span></div></section><p class="note">※ 퇴근 시간이 출근 시간보다 이르면 다음 날 퇴근으로 계산합니다. 수당은 초과근무시간 × 입력 단가이며, 기관별 인정시간·상한·가산 규정은 별도로 반영해야 합니다.</p></main><script>function calculate(){const s=document.getElementById('start').value,e=document.getElementById('end').value;if(!s||!e){alert('출퇴근 시간을 입력하세요.');return;}const toMin=t=>{let [h,m]=t.split(':').map(Number);return h*60+m};let elapsed=(toMin(e)-toMin(s)+1440)%1440;let rest=Number(document.getElementById('breaks').value),regular=Number(document.getElementById('regular').value),rate=Number(document.getElementById('rate').value);if([rest,regular,rate].some(v=>!Number.isFinite(v)||v<0)){alert('0 이상의 값을 입력하세요.');return;}let worked=Math.max(0,elapsed-rest),extra=Math.max(0,worked-regular*60);const fmt=m=>`${Math.floor(m/60)}시간 ${Math.round(m%60)}분`;document.getElementById('worked').textContent=fmt(worked);document.getElementById('extra').textContent=fmt(extra);document.getElementById('pay').textContent=Math.round(extra/60*rate).toLocaleString('ko-KR')+'원';}calculate();</script></body></html>
